sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Business Flow
  participant Backend as Connector Backend
  participant Endpoint
  participant Delivery
  participant Queue
  participant API as External API

  App->>Backend: queue_outbound_delivery(...)
  Backend->>Endpoint: get_outbound_endpoint(code_suffix)
  Endpoint->>Delivery: Create queued delivery + context
  Delivery->>Queue: Enqueue send job
  Queue->>Backend: _handle_outbound_webhook_delivery(delivery, request)
  alt Handler returns cancel/done/retry/dead_letter
    Queue->>Delivery: Apply outcome state
  else Handler allows send or mutate
    Queue->>API: Send HTTP request
    API-->>Queue: Response or error
    Queue->>Delivery: Log attempt and update state
    Queue->>Backend: _handle_outbound_webhook_response(...)
    alt Retryable failure
      Queue->>Queue: Reschedule (exponential backoff)
    end
  end
